# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# Every Dockerfile here ends with `COPY . .`, so anything not listed below is
# baked into the image. Keep secrets and local state out.
#
# NOTE: this file is NOT .gitignore. Two things are gitignored but MUST stay in
# the image, so they are deliberately absent from this file:
#   - chat_connect/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/*.mo  (compiled translations, runtime)
#   - redis.conf                              (only read by the redis service)

# --- Secrets: never bake credentials into an image ---------------------------
# Dev gets .env through the `- .:/usr/src/app` bind mount; prod and celery load
# it through `env_file:` in the compose file. Neither needs it copied in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
prod.txt
prod*.txt

# --- VCS ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Node: build-time only ---------------------------------------------------
# package.json only provides `sass`, which compiles
# chat_connect/static/style/scss -> .../css. The compiled CSS is committed, so
# the image never needs node_modules.
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json

# --- Python caches -----------------------------------------------------------
# Docker matches these against the whole relative path and does NOT walk into
# subdirectories the way .gitignore does, so nested matches need an explicit
# `**/` prefix. `__pycache__` alone would only ignore the one at the repo root.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/*.egg-info
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache

# --- Test / coverage output --------------------------------------------------
.coverage
.coverage.*
.coveragerc
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
test.patch

# --- Editors / tooling -------------------------------------------------------
.idea
.vscode
.claude
.python-version

# --- Local runtime state -----------------------------------------------------
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat-schedule.*
**/*.log
db.sqlite3
media/

# --- Docs and planning -------------------------------------------------------
docs/
**/*.md
plan-*.prompt.md

# --- Compose / deploy descriptors (not needed inside the image) --------------
docker-compose*.yml
nginx.conf
